# ======================================================================
# DOUBLE-STRUCK / BLACKBOARD BOLD ALPHABET
# ======================================================================

# Compose + d + <letter>
# Mathematical double-struck (𝔸, 𝔹, etc.)
# Some have dedicated code points (ℂ, ℍ, ℕ, ℙ, ℚ, ℝ, ℤ)

# --- Double-struck capitals (d + uppercase) ---
